WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,810 --> 00:00:10,750
Boss, you are back

2
00:00:10,750 --> 00:00:13,650
It's already past work time

3
00:00:13,650 --> 00:00:14,650
Why haven't you left yet?

4
00:00:14,650 --> 00:00:16,650
I've only been here a few days

5
00:00:16,650 --> 00:00:18,650
There are many things in the store that I’m not familiar with yet.

6
00:00:18,650 --> 00:00:20,650
Anyway, it won't be a big deal if I go back.

7
00:00:20,650 --> 00:00:21,650
Just stayed a little longer

8
00:00:21,650 --> 00:00:22,710
you wait here

9
00:00:22,710 --> 00:00:37,570
where do you live

10
00:00:37,570 --> 00:00:38,570
I'll give it to you

11
00:00:38,570 --> 00:00:39,570
No need, no need

12
00:00:39,570 --> 00:00:41,570
I'll just go out and find a shared bicycle.
